       - If detected as "male", return "men".\n        - If detected as "female", return "women".\n        - If detected as "child", determine "boy" or "girl" based on facial features and clothing style.\n      \n        2. **Outfit Attributes**\n        - "primary_color": The dominant color of the outfit.\n        - "secondary_color": A secondary color if present, otherwise null.\n        - "brand": Extract the brand if visible. If unknown, return null.\n        - "category": Identify the type of clothing (e.g., "T-shirt", "jeans", "jacket", "sneakers").\n        - "material": Extract the fabric type if visible (e.g., "cotton", "denim", "leather", "polyester").\n      \n        3. **Extracted Outfit (Searchable Format)**\n        - List **each detected clothing item** dynamically.\n        - Format for each item: "<clothing_item>: <gender> <primary_color> <secondary_color> <brand> <material> <category>"\n        - If any value is null, **skip it instead of writing "null"**.\n        - Example:\n          "extracted_outfit": {\n            "T-Shirt": "<gender> <primary_color> <secondary_color> <brand> <material> <category>",\n            "Joggers": "<gender> <primary_color> <brand> <material> <category>"\n          }\n      \n        4. **Suggested Outfit (Detailed Styling)**\n        - Provide recommendations for styling based on detected outfit.\n        - Each suggested item must include:\n          - "search_term": Suggestive Search Term (e.g "Rugged Blue Jeans", "White Sneakers").\n          - "category": T-shirt, Jeans, jacket, sneakers, etc.\n          - "type_of_wear": Suggested occasions (e.g., "casual wear", "formal wear", "party wear").\n          - "description": A suggestive style description in 50 words.\n          - "color": Suggest the color (e.g "blue", "black").\n          - "material": Suggest the material (e.g "cotton", "denim").\n        - Example:\n          "bottomwear": {\n            "search_term": "Rugged Blue Jeans",\n            "category": "Denim Jeans", \n            "type_of_wear": "casual wear",\n            "description": "Blue jeans with wrinkles for a rugged look",\n            "color": Suggest the color (e.g "blue", "black"),\n            "material": Suggest the material (e.g "cotton", "denim")\n          },\n          "footwear": {\n            "search_term": "White Sneakers",\n            "category": "Sneakers",\n            "description": "White sneakers with a minimalist design",\n            "type_of_wear": "casual wear, streetwear",\n            "color": Suggest the color (e.g "white", "black"),\n            "material": Suggest the material (e.g "leather", "canvas")\n          }\n      \n        5. **Image Data Extraction**\n        - **Detected Items**: Provide a list of extracted items with bounding box coordinates, confidence score, and relative position ("upper_body", "lower_body", "accessory_zone").\n        - **Brand Logo Detection**: Indicate if a brand logo is detected (true or false).\n      \n        **STRICT RULES:**\n        - Return a valid JSON object without any markdown formatting.\n        - Do NOT add markdown formatting in the output.\n        - DO NOT return "male" or "female", always return "men" or "women".\n        - Ensure JSON format is valid and contains no extra commas.\n        - Return null for unknown values instead of "Unknown".\n        - extracted_outfit should be a sensible searchable format that can be used to search for similar items.\n      \n        Return the output in the following valid JSON format:\n      \n        {\n          "gender": "<men | women | kid | boy | girl>",\n          "primary_color": "<string>",\n          "secondary_color": "<string | null>",\n          "brand": "<string | null>",\n          "category": "<string | null>",\n          "material": "<string | null>",\n          "extracted_outfit": {\n            "<clothing_item>": "<formatted string>"\n          },\n          "suggested_outfit": {\n            "bottomwear": {\n            "search_term": "<string | null>",\n            "category": "<string | null>", \n            "type_of_wear": "<string | null>",\n            "description": "<string | null>",\n            "color": "<string | null>",\n            "material": "<string | null>"\n            },\n            "footwear": {\n            "search_term": "<string | null>",\n            "category": "<string | null>", \n            "type_of_wear": "<string | null>",\n            "description": "<string | null>",\n            "color": "<string | null>",\n            "material": "<string | null>"\n            },\n            "accessory": {\n            "search_term": "<string | null>",\n            "category": "<string | null>", \n            "type_of_wear": "<string | null>",\n            "description": "<string | null>",\n            "color": "<string | null>",\n            "material": "<string | null>"\n            }\n          },\n          "image_data_extraction": {\n            "extracted_items": [\n              {\n                "label": "<string>",\n                "bounding_box": {\n                  "x": <number>,\n                  "y": <number>,\n                  "width": <number>,\n                  "height": <number>\n                },\n                "relative_position": "<upper_body | lower_body | accessory_zone>",\n                "confidence": <number>\n              }\n            ],\n            "logo_detected": <true | false>\n          }\n        }'},{type:"image",value:a}]}]);case 4:u=e.v,c=f(u),l(c);try{JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("suggestions")||"[]"),s=[c],localStorage.setItem("suggestions",JSON.stringify(s))}catch(e){console.error("Failed to update localStorage:",e)}return e.a(2,{result:c});case 5:if(!t){e.n=6;break}throw new Error("LanguageModel API not available");case 6:return p=n.replace(/^data:image\/(png|jpeg|jpg);base64,/,""),e.p=7,e.n=8,(0,r.Z)(p,"10","1","v1","png");case 8:return m=e.v,e.a(2,{products:m});case 9:return e.p=9,v=e.v,console.error